WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.520
What happened when the Desire Camera took&nbsp;
a photo of SCP-035, the Possessive Mask?

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.520
The photo was taken while the mask was at rest&nbsp;
in its containment chamber, and the output&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:15.680
was SCP-035 is being worn by an unidentified&nbsp;
individual sitting on a throne. On the floor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.280
there are 3 dead masked individuals. The location&nbsp;
of the picture appears to be [DATA EXPUNGED].

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.680
Well. I can’t say this was that surprising…

